{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q416632","formula":"C₂₅H₃₂ClN₅O₂","hill":"C25H32ClN5O2","elements":["H","C","N","O","Cl"],"composition":{"C":25.0,"H":32.0,"N":5.0,"O":2.0,"Cl":1.0},"names":{"en":"Nefazodone","uk":"Нефазодон"},"descriptions":{"en":"Nefazodone, sold formerly under the brand names Serzone, Dutonin, and Nefadar among others, is an atypical antidepressant medication which is used in the treatment of depression and for other uses. Nefazodone was withdrawn in most countries by 2004 due to liver toxicity. In December 2021, it was published that despite shortage it is still available in the United States.","uk":"Нефазодон (англ. Nefazodone), випускався під торговими марками «Серзон», «Дутонін», «Нефадар» — атиповий антидепресант, який використовується для лікування депресії та при інших показах. Нефазодон все ще доступний у США, але в більшості країн його було вилучено через рідкісну токсичність для печінки."},"fame":20,"pubchemCid":4449,"mass":470.0,"charge":0,"smiles":"CCC1=NN(C(=O)N1CCOC2=CC=CC=C2)CCCN3CCN(CC3)C4=CC(=CC=C4)Cl","inchikey":"VRBKIVRKKCLPHA-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"2-[3-[4-(3-chlorophenyl)piperazin-1-yl]propyl]-5-ethyl-4-(2-phenoxyethyl)-1,2,4-triazol-3-one","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"4449","atoms":65,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-6.42,"y":2.927,"z":-0.618,"el":"Cl"},{"x":4.081,"y":-0.433,"z":2.191,"el":"O"},{"x":3.269,"y":2.26,"z":0.826,"el":"O"},{"x":-0.916,"y":-2.425,"z":0.389,"el":"N"},{"x":-3.465,"y":-1.219,"z":-0.063,"el":"N"},{"x":3.425,"y":-1.978,"z":0.54,"el":"N"},{"x":4.475,"y":-0.144,"z":-0.1,"el":"N"},{"x":3.535,"y":-2.038,"z":-0.824,"el":"N"},{"x":-1.696,"y":-2.763,"z":-0.807,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.15,"y":-1.024,"z":0.759,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.195,"y":-2.571,"z":-0.559,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.63,"y":-0.775,"z":1.06,"el":"C"}